{"version":1,"content":"<p>元朗警區特別職務隊昨日（29日）聯同入境處人員，於區內展開代號「火石」的打擊非法賣淫活動行動，拘捕23名內地女子，年齡介乎19至49歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。</p><p>被捕人現正被扣留調查。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:46:21.487639+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:24:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:18:59.138637+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:39:42.384544+00:00","content_hash":"b1574da1f2e09b5588e9344b041368d583e04c364465ea68d540e05768e497ab","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}